# Task Master Rule

For every scoped task:

- Keep a checklist in the ticket plan or tasklist.
- Mark an item complete only after its AC has passed Verification.
- Record blockers, skipped checks and follow-up work explicitly.
- When a task is verified, update `memory_bank/progress.md` and link the next
  task.

Do not silently abandon unfinished tasks or represent unrun tests as passed.
